{"4348740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stardust Sandbox", "steam_appid": 4348740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A physical sandbox to experiment, create and observe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stardust Sandbox </strong>is a creative sandbox simulation inspired by classic falling-sand games. The game provides a free, experimental environment where each element follows its own physical rules, allowing you to build structures, trigger reactions, and observe emergent behaviors naturally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total freedom, no pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create complex systems, test specific interactions, set up simple scenarios, or simply relax and watch the world react to your actions. Stardust Sandbox adapts to players who enjoy deep experimentation as well as those who prefer a contemplative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session is different — small changes can produce completely unexpected results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >91 interactive elements with unique behaviors  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based sandbox simulation  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full control over time (pause and resume the simulation at any moment)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, open-ended gameplay  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art visuals    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day–night cycle system  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A space for curiosity and creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy sandbox simulations, emergent systems, creative experimentation, or simply relaxing by watching simple rules generate complex outcomes, <strong>Stardust Sandbox </strong>offers a place where logic and imagination meet.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A physical sandbox to experiment, create and observe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stardust Sandbox </strong>is a creative sandbox simulation inspired by classic falling-sand games. The game provides a free, experimental environment where each element follows its own physical rules, allowing you to build structures, trigger reactions, and observe emergent behaviors naturally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total freedom, no pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create complex systems, test specific interactions, set up simple scenarios, or simply relax and watch the world react to your actions. Stardust Sandbox adapts to players who enjoy deep experimentation as well as those who prefer a contemplative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session is different — small changes can produce completely unexpected results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >91 interactive elements with unique behaviors  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based sandbox simulation  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full control over time (pause and resume the simulation at any moment)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, open-ended gameplay  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art visuals    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day–night cycle system  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A space for curiosity and creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy sandbox simulations, emergent systems, creative experimentation, or simply relaxing by watching simple rules generate complex outcomes, <strong>Stardust Sandbox </strong>offers a place where logic and imagination meet.</p>", "short_description": "A creative sandbox simulation where you experiment with physical interactions, bui